hpc:WCKeyResponse a owl:Class .
hpc:OpenapiWCKeyResp a owl:Class .
hpc:OpenapiResp a owl:Class .

hpc:hasContent a owl:ObjectProperty .

hpc:WCKeyResponse rdfs:subClassOf hpc:OpenapiWCKeyResp .
hpc:OpenapiWCKeyResp rdfs:subClassOf hpc:OpenapiResp .

hpc:hasContent rdfs:domain hpc:OpenapiResp ;
                 rdfs:range xsd:string .
```

This ontology fragment represents three classes: `WCKeyResponse`, `OpenapiWCKeyResp`, and `OpenapiResp`. It also declares an object property `hasContent` that is used by the `OpenapiResp` class. The `hasContent` property has a domain of `OpenapiResp` and a range of `xsd:string`.
